  "bodyText": "PrSAT 3.0\n\n\nFor more information regarding syntax, usage, etc., see the official PrSAT 3.0 webpage.\n\n\nHere is a brief video demo of the software. The text file for the demo can be downloaded here.\nPr\n(\nA\n)\n=\n1\n2\nPr\n(\nB\n|\nA\n)\n=\n3\n4\nRegular:\nTimeout:\nseconds\nConstraints are SATisfiable!\nA\tB\t\n𝑎\n𝑖\n\tAssignment\n⊤\t⊤\t\n𝑎\n1\n\t\n3\n8\n\n⊤\t⊥\t\n𝑎\n2\n\t\n1\n8\n\n⊥\t⊤\t\n𝑎\n3\n\t\n0\n\n⊥\t⊥\t\n𝑎\n4\n\t\n1\n2\nEvaluate model\n𝑎\n1\n+\n𝑎\n2\n=\n1\n2\n𝑎\n1\n𝑎\n1\n+\n𝑎\n2\n=\n3\n4",
